# inc-w91w: fire the bow at the EMPTY square of a found trap, three squares
# east, through the real fire key and the location cursor.
# NOTE: lowercase f; uppercase F sets SHIFT and fires in a direction.
# LEFT then RIGHT is two bounded steps (`s` would start extended searching) so
# the vision pass sees the room the probe rebuilt; before it the prompt calls
# every square "unseen area". @expect proves the targeting prompt is up.
@while "-- more --" SPACE
LEFT
RIGHT
f
@expect "Select direction, location or target"
l
RIGHT*3
@dump:shot-cursor
ENTER
@while "Really fire" y
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@dump:shot-after
@quit
